      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ciaŋ bo̱thä palä Mal-ki-dhɛ-dɛk",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7:1-2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Tuk 14:17-20.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä Mal-ki-dhɛ-dɛk ɛmɛ, jɛn ɛ kuäär Ca-lɛm, kä ɛ bo̱o̱th palä Kuɔth in Di̱t ni jɛn kä ti diaal, cuɛ röm kɛ A-bɛ-ram lunyädɛ jɔk jucä kua̱ri, kä cuɛ A-bɛ-ram poth”, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä cu A-bɛ-ram ɛ ka̱m “wäl wäli ŋɔaani diaal tëë cɛ pɛc.” Kä luɔt cio̱tädɛ kɛ nhiam “lotdɛ ni ɣöö kuäär cuŋni”, kä jɛn bä ɛ kuäär Ca-lɛm, min lot ni ɣöö “kuäär malä.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jɛn thilɛ jɛ gua̱n kiɛ man kiɛ gua̱ndɔɔŋnikɛ, kä thilɛ jɛ tuk ni̱ni, kiɛ pek teekä bä, kä jɛn cäätdɛ kɛ Gat Kuɔth, kä jɛn tëë thi̱n ala bo̱o̱th palä mi do̱raar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nɛ̈nɛ jɛ di̱tdɛ i̱di! A cäŋɛ ni gua̱ndɔɔŋdan ni A-bɛ-ram cuɛ jɛ ka̱m wäl wäli ŋɔaani diaal tëë pɛɛcɛ ko̱o̱r. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuay Lii-bay tëë la bööth palä tekɛ kɛ cuɔ̱ɔ̱ŋ rɛy ŋutdä kɛ ɣöö ba wäl wäli ka̱n kä ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl tin la ji̱ wecdiɛn, a cäŋ ni mɔ kɛn diaal kuay A-bɛ-ram ɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä jɛn wut ɛmɛ mɛ thil kaar kuayni ji̱ Lii-bay ɛ cuɛ wäl wäli ka̱n kä A-bɛ-ram, kä cuɛ A-bɛ-ram poth ram in ci tëë ca la̱r jɛ jek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä thilɛ diw, ɛn ɣöö puɔthkɛ ram mi tɔt ɛ ram mi di̱i̱t. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ gua̱a̱th kɛl ka̱nkɛ wäl wäli ɛ ji̱ Lii-bay, kä kɛ gua̱a̱th mi dɔ̱ŋ ka̱nkɛ kɛ ɛ Mal-ki-dhɛ-dɛk ce̱tkɛ min ca gɔ̱r. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dee raan ɛ lar ɛn ɣöö Lii-bay in kän wäl wäli nyinä nath puɔ̱nydɛ, cuɛ wäl wäli nyinikɛ thöp kɛ A-bɛ-ram mëë tho̱pɛ nyinkɛ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kɛ ɣöö ŋotdɛ tëë puɔ̱ny gua̱ndɔɔŋdɛ, ɛ nëë ro̱m Mal-ki-dhɛ-dɛk kɛnɛ A-bɛ-ram.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bo̱o̱th palä mi da̱ŋ mi ce̱tkɛ Mal-ki-dhɛ-dɛk",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ kui̱ bo̱thä palä ji̱ Lii-bay ɛn nëë ka̱mkɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl ŋuɔ̱t kɛ jɛ. Kä mi dee naath ciaaŋ mi thil diw jek kɛ jɛn ciaaŋ palä ɛmɔ, kuɛ la ŋu ruac naath kɛ kui̱ bo̱o̱th palä dɔ̱diɛn mi dee jɔɔc ce̱tkɛ Mal-ki-dhɛ-dɛk ɔ a /ci mɔ a bo̱o̱th palä mi ce̱tkɛ Ä-ron? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi tëëkɛ ciaaŋ bo̱thä palä mi dɔ̱ŋ, bɛ tekɛ ŋuɔ̱t ti kɔ̱ŋ bä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö ɛn ram min latkɛ ti̱ti̱ kɛ kui̱dɛ ɛ raan thuɔ̱k duëël mi dɔ̱diɛn, mi thilɛ ram mi ci met lät ala bo̱o̱th palä wi̱i̱ yi̱kä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö jɔcɛ ɛn ɣöö Kuääran ni Kuoth ɛ kuɛ̈ɛ̈ mi bëë kä ji̱ Juda, kä thilɛ ruac bo̱thä palä mi ci Muthɛ ɛ lat kɛ kui̱ thuɔk duëël ɛmɔ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛn nɛmɛ cua ŋa̱c a gɔaa, mëë ci bo̱o̱th palä mi dɔ̱diɛn ɛmɛ jɔɔc mi ce̱tkɛ Mal-ki-dhɛ-dɛk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka̱n jɛ jak kä bo̱o̱th palä kɛ buɔ̱m nath kɛnɛ ŋuɔ̱tkiɛn, duundɛ ɣöö ɛ buɔ̱m teekädɛ mi thil pek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö ca lar kɛ kui̱dɛ i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7:17",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Diit 110:4.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua nɛmɛ la̱t kɛ ya̱c ɛ Kuoth. Kä cu nɛy tin kɔ̱ŋ a bööth palä a thil ya̱c. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö cu Yecu a bo̱o̱th palä kɛ ya̱c mëë ci Kuoth ɛ jiök i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7:21",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Diit 110:4.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bööth palä tëë nhiam ŋuankɛ, kɛ ɣöö /cakɛ pën la̱tdiɛn ɛ lia̱a̱. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ ɣöö tëk Yecu kɛ tëk mi do̱raar, bɛ lät ala bo̱o̱th palä mi thil pek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ tëëkɛ lua̱ŋ gua̱thni diaal kɛ ka̱n nɛɛni tin bä kä Kuoth kɛ jɛ, kä tëkɛ ni ciaŋ kɛ ɣöö bɛ la̱ŋ kɛ kui̱diɛn.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
